{"reviewId": "39744919_86fJYWt9D", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "可是现在回过头看，得益于这个阶段的投资，地铁/高铁等基础设施的投入，如果是20年后的人口出生率或者换个国家，肯定不能这么投，根本收不回来，他们只能就是破破旧旧亦或者长期无法完工，不是做不了，而是划不来。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "所以，虽然技术创新更容易被理解为信息技术、生物技术，而对中国更具意义的却是铁路技术、新材料技术，这更符合中国在工业化转型期技术扩散的特征。", "range": "5491-5560", "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "39744919_86fJYWt9D", "userVid": 39744919, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768744662, "userEditTime": 1768744712, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 39744919, "name": "拉不拉多", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-MaYu75r4o_3YhIbks6tf9c3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "拉不拉多", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "📝叽歪黄油小面包", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241021-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 9, "likes": [{"userVid": 900802853, "name": "家有垂耳兔", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-eVxPJg8_ZdR5Gy5EmFnB110/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "家有垂耳兔", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240923-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "无序扩张是我们的主旋律，终究被反噬", "reviewId": "39744919_86fJYWt9D", "commentId": "39744919_86fJYWt9D_c900802853_86skVGdrg", "userVid": 900802853, "cre